icBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                MEMBER_OF\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Duke Leto \u2192 House Atreides\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"an apparent victory for the Duke Leto\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "House Atreides", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Duke Leto", "label": "POPULAR_AMONG", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                POPULAR_AMONG\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Duke Leto \u2192 Great Houses of the Landsraad\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"the Duke Leto was popular among the Great Houses of the Landsraad\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Great Houses of the Landsraad", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#f28b82", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Duke Leto", "label": "ENEMY_OF", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #f28b82;\u0027\u003e\n                ENEMY_OF\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Duke Leto \u2192 House Harkonnen\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #f28b82;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"It will take more than a trap to catch the Duke Leto.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "House Harkonnen", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#81c995", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Duke Leto", "label": "FAMILY_OF", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #81c995;\u0027\u003e\n                FAMILY_OF\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Duke Leto \u2192 his son\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #81c995;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"this is the Duke Leto, and this one\u0027s his son\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "his son", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Duke Leto", "label": "KNOWS", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                KNOWS\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Duke Leto \u2192 Lady Jessica\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"The voice was Duke Leto\u0027s. She whirled, saw him striding from the arched passage to the dining hall.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Lady Jessica", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.88}, "dashes": false, "from": "Duke Leto", "label": "WORKS_FOR", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                WORKS_FOR\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Duke Leto \u2192 Emperor\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.80\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"He had become such a savage, driving person since the decision to bow to the Emperor\u0027s command.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Emperor", "width": 3.3000000000000003}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Duke Leto", "label": "LOCATED_IN", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                LOCATED_IN\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Duke Leto \u2192 Caladan\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"We did not live this way on Caladan.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Caladan", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.88}, "dashes": false, "from": "Duke Leto", "label": "PARTICIPATES_IN", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                PARTICIPATES_IN\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Duke Leto \u2192 water riots\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.80\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"There were water riots when it was learned how many people the Duke was adding to the population\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "water riots", "width": 3.3000000000000003}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#81c995", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Duke Leto", "label": "FAMILY_OF", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #81c995;\u0027\u003e\n                FAMILY_OF\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Duke Leto \u2192 the father\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #81c995;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"That\u0027s the man shaped by the father.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "the father", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#f28b82", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Duke Leto", "label": "ENEMY_OF", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #f28b82;\u0027\u003e\n                ENEMY_OF\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Duke Leto \u2192 Harkonnen agents\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #f28b82;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"Light signals could only mean that messages were being sent between his enemies--between Harkonnen agents.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Harkonnen agents", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#fdd663", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Duke Leto", "label": "LEADS", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #fdd663;\u0027\u003e\n                LEADS\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Duke Leto \u2192 Arrakis\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #fdd663;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"\"It is said that the Duke Leto Atreides rules with the consent of the governed,\" the Fremen said.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Arrakis", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Duke Leto", "label": "MENTIONED_IN", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                MENTIONED_IN\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Duke Leto \u2192 Arrakis\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"It\u0027s one of Duke Leto\u0027s fighting men we took on Arrakis!\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Arrakis", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Duke Leto", "label": "MENTIONED_IN", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                MENTIONED_IN\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Duke Leto \u2192 EVENT\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"\"You be the Duke Leto, I warrant,\" he said.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "EVENT", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Duke Leto", "label": "WORKS_FOR", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                WORKS_FOR\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Duke Leto \u2192 Duke\u0027s ship\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"let the Duke fly his ship\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Duke\u0027s ship", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#fdd663", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Duke Leto", "label": "LEADS", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #fdd663;\u0027\u003e\n                LEADS\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Duke Leto \u2192 his escort\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #fdd663;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"His escort came down from circling stations, took up positions above and on both sides.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "his escort", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Duke Leto", "label": "LOCATED_IN", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                LOCATED_IN\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Duke Leto \u2192 Shield Wall\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"The Duke brought his craft around toward the Shield Wall.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Shield Wall", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#f28b82", "opacity": 0.88}, "dashes": false, "from": "Duke Leto", "label": "HATES", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #f28b82;\u0027\u003e\n                HATES\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Duke Leto \u2192 one we hate above all others\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #f28b82;\u0027\u003e0.80\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"one we hate above all others died with him.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "one we hate above all others", "width": 3.3000000000000003}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#81c995", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Duke Leto", "label": "FAMILY_OF", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #81c995;\u0027\u003e\n                FAMILY_OF\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Duke Leto \u2192 Paul Atreides\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #81c995;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"Duke Leto\u0027s death\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Paul Atreides", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#81c995", "opacity": 0.88}, "dashes": false, "from": "Duke Leto", "label": "FAMILY_OF", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #81c995;\u0027\u003e\n                FAMILY_OF\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Duke Leto \u2192 Baron\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #81c995;\u0027\u003e0.80\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"Even the Duke Leto, a cousin on the distaff side, never knew for sure.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Baron", "width": 3.3000000000000003}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Mentat", "label": "WORKS_FOR", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                WORKS_FOR\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Mentat \u2192 Duke Leto\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"Thufir Hawat, his father\u0027s Master of Assassins\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Duke Leto", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#81c995", "opacity": 0.88}, "dashes": false, "from": "Mentat", "label": "FRIENDS_WITH", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #81c995;\u0027\u003e\n                FRIENDS_WITH\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Mentat \u2192 Muad\u0027Dib\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #81c995;\u0027\u003e0.80\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"There was Thufir Hawat, the old Mentat Master of Assassins, who struck fear even into the heart of the Padishah Emperor.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Muad\u0027Dib", "width": 3.3000000000000003}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Mentat", "label": "KNOWS", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                KNOWS\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Mentat \u2192 Paul Atreides\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"Hawat cleared his throat. Paul remained bent over his studies.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Paul Atreides", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Mentat", "label": "SERVES", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                SERVES\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Mentat \u2192 Paul Atreides\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"\"I serve the . . . Lisan al-Gaib,\" Hawat said.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Paul Atreides", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Mentat", "label": "PLEDGED_TO", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                PLEDGED_TO\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Mentat \u2192 Paul Atreides\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"\"I\u0027ve pledged myself to this.\"\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Paul Atreides", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Mentat", "label": "WORKS_FOR", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                WORKS_FOR\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Mentat \u2192 Duke Paulus Atreides\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"where it had been slashed once in the service of the Old Duke\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Duke Paulus Atreides", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Mentat", "label": "KNOWS", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                KNOWS\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Mentat \u2192 Reverend Mother\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"\"Did you meet the Reverend Mother?\"\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Reverend Mother", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#fdd663", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Mentat", "label": "LEADS", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #fdd663;\u0027\u003e\n                LEADS\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Mentat \u2192 guards\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #fdd663;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"Those guards outside are his men\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "guards", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#fdd663", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Mentat", "label": "LEADS", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #fdd663;\u0027\u003e\n                LEADS\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Mentat \u2192 cargo handlers\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #fdd663;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"The cargo handlers are his men\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "cargo handlers", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Mentat", "label": "MENTIONED_IN", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                MENTIONED_IN\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Mentat \u2192 death and deceit\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"Where Thufir Hawat goes, death and deceit follow\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "death and deceit", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Mentat", "label": "WORKS_FOR", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                WORKS_FOR\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Mentat \u2192 Leto Atreides\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"Thufir Hawat strode through it looking older and more leathery than ever. He paced down the length of the table, stopped at attention facing Leto.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Leto Atreides", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Mentat", "label": "WORKS_FOR", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                WORKS_FOR\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Mentat \u2192 Duke\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"I can speak for my Duke.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Duke", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#81c995", "opacity": 0.88}, "dashes": false, "from": "Mentat", "label": "FRIENDS_WITH", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #81c995;\u0027\u003e\n                FRIENDS_WITH\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Mentat \u2192 Fremen\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #81c995;\u0027\u003e0.80\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"Peace, friend,\" the Fremen cautioned.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Fremen", "width": 3.3000000000000003}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Mentat", "label": "KNOWS", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                KNOWS\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Mentat \u2192 Fremen\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"\"You are Thufir Hawat,\" the man said matter-of-factly.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Fremen", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Mentat", "label": "PARTICIPATES_IN", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                PARTICIPATES_IN\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Mentat \u2192 vendetta\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"The vendetta I\u0027ll handle myself.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "vendetta", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.8200000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Mentat", "label": "MENTIONED_IN", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                MENTIONED_IN\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Mentat \u2192 vendetta\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.70\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"The vendetta I\u0027ll handle myself.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "vendetta", "width": 2.9499999999999997}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#f28b82", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Mentat", "label": "ENEMY_OF", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #f28b82;\u0027\u003e\n                ENEMY_OF\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Mentat \u2192 House Harkonnen\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #f28b82;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"We both fight Harkonnens,\" Hawat said.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "House Harkonnen", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Mentat", "label": "WORKS_FOR", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                WORKS_FOR\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Mentat \u2192 House Harkonnen\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"Thufir Hawat\u0027s with \u0027em, m\u0027Lord. I had no chance to see him alone, but he used our old hand signs to say he\u0027s been working with the Harkonnens\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "House Harkonnen", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Mentat", "label": "PARTICIPATES_IN", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                PARTICIPATES_IN\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Mentat \u2192 bond of water\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"\"The bond of water,\" Hawat said.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "bond of water", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#f28b82", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Mentat", "label": "HATES", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #f28b82;\u0027\u003e\n                HATES\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Mentat \u2192 Jessica Atreides\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #f28b82;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"He has spoken only enough, m\u0027Lord, to reveal his belief that the Lady Jessica was his betrayer.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Jessica Atreides", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Mentat", "label": "WORKS_FOR", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                WORKS_FOR\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Mentat \u2192 Baron\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"Thufir Hawat, is not dead but in your employ.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Baron", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.8200000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Mentat", "label": "MENTIONED_IN", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                MENTIONED_IN\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Mentat \u2192 The Sayings of Muad\u0027Dib\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.70\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"-from \"The Sayings of Muad\u0027Dib\" by the Princess Irulan\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "The Sayings of Muad\u0027Dib", "width": 2.9499999999999997}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Mentat", "label": "KNOWS", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                KNOWS\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Mentat \u2192 Baron Vladimir Harkonnen\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"\"You may speak plainly with me, Hawat,\" the Baron rumbled.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Baron Vladimir Harkonnen", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Mentat", "label": "LOCATED_IN", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                LOCATED_IN\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Mentat \u2192 Arrakis\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"Thufir Hawat beside him\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Arrakis", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Mentat", "label": "MENTIONED_IN", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                MENTIONED_IN\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Mentat \u2192 passage\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"a face and figure emerged -Thufir Hawat, the seamed old features with darkly stained lips, the hunched shoulders, the look of fragile age about him.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "passage", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Mentat", "label": "WORKS_FOR", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                WORKS_FOR\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Mentat \u2192 Paul\u0027s family\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"in payment for your years of service to my family\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Paul\u0027s family", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Mentat", "label": "MENTIONED_IN", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                MENTIONED_IN\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Mentat \u2192 skills\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"\"Your own Thufir Hawat taught me some of my skills,\" Feyd-Rautha said.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "skills", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#f28b82", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "House Harkonnen", "label": "ENEMY_OF", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #f28b82;\u0027\u003e\n                ENEMY_OF\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                House Harkonnen \u2192 House Atreides\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #f28b82;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"their mortal enemies, the Harkonnens\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "House Atreides", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "House Harkonnen", "label": "LEAVES", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                LEAVES\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                House Harkonnen \u2192 House Atreides\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"the Harkonnens were leaving to be replaced by the House of Atreides\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "House Atreides", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "House Harkonnen", "label": "LOCATED_IN", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                LOCATED_IN\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                House Harkonnen \u2192 Arrakis\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"the Harkonnens, had been on Arrakis eighty years\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Arrakis", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "House Harkonnen", "label": "MENTIONED_IN", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                MENTIONED_IN\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                House Harkonnen \u2192 Arrakis\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"The Harkonnens sealed off many sources of information about Arrakis.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Arrakis", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.88}, "dashes": false, "from": "House Harkonnen", "label": "MEMBER_OF", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                MEMBER_OF\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                House Harkonnen \u2192 Imperial House\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.80\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"since House Harkonnen is being used to do the Imperial dirty work\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Imperial House", "width": 3.3000000000000003}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#fdd663", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "House Harkonnen", "label": "OWNS", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #fdd663;\u0027\u003e\n                OWNS\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                House Harkonnen \u2192 CHOAM\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #fdd663;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"we\u0027ll have an irrevocable directorship in the CHOAM Company.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "CHOAM", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "House Harkonnen", "label": "WILL_HAVE", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                WILL_HAVE\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                House Harkonnen \u2192 subfief on Arrakis\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"House Harkonnen will have a subfief on Arrakis within a Standard year.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "subfief on Arrakis", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#f28b82", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "House Harkonnen", "label": "ENEMY_OF", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #f28b82;\u0027\u003e\n                ENEMY_OF\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                House Harkonnen \u2192 Paul Atreides\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #f28b82;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"The Harkonnens have been stockpiling for more than twenty years. They mean spice production to fail and you to be blamed.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Paul Atreides", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "House Harkonnen", "label": "STOCKPILING", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                STOCKPILING\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                House Harkonnen \u2192 melange\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"Knowing that the Harkonnens stockpile melange\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "melange", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#f28b82", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "House Harkonnen", "label": "ENEMY_OF", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #f28b82;\u0027\u003e\n                ENEMY_OF\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                House Harkonnen \u2192 Fremen\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #f28b82;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"The Harkonnens sneered at the Fremen, hunted them for sport\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Fremen", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.8200000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "House Harkonnen", "label": "LOCATED_IN", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-fami