margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"in the Fremen messianic legend, \"The One Who Will Lead Us to Paradise.\"\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "MAHDI", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Fremen", "label": "LOCATED_IN", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                LOCATED_IN\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Fremen \u2192 cave warren\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"the term came by general usage to designate any cave warren inhabited by one of their tribal communities.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "cave warren", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.940000000000