px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #fdd663;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"The Guild was the second mental-physical training school\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Great Convention", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#fdd663", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Guild", "label": "OWNS", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #fdd663;\u0027\u003e\n                OWNS\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Guild \u2192 monopoly on space travel and transport and upon international banking\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #fdd663;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"The Guild monopoly on space travel and transport and upon international banking\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "monopoly on space travel and transport and upon international banking", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Guild", "label": "MEMBER_OF", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                MEMBER_OF\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Guild \u2192 Spacing Guild\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"SPACING GUILD: see Guild.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Spacing Guild", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Guild", "label": "MAINTAINS", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-fami