 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                WORKS_FOR\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Hawat \u2192 Sire\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"\"Hawat has an agent there waiting to take them.\"\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Sire", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.8200000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Hawat", "label": "KNOWS", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                KNOWS\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Hawat \u2192 House Harkonnen\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.70\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"\"Hawat believes there could be some bad ones planted in the group, but he sees assassins in every shadow.\"\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "House Harkonnen", "width": 2.9499999999999997}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#f28b82", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Hawat", "label": "ENEMY_OF", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #f28b82;\u0027\u003e\n                ENEMY_OF\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Hawat \u2192 House Harkonnen\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #f28b82;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"But Hawat is now a Harkonnen captive.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "House Harkonnen", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#81c995", "opacity": 0.88}, "dashes": false, "from": "Hawat", "label": "FRIENDS_WITH", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #81c995;\u0027\u003e\n                FRIENDS_WITH\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Hawat \u2192 Leto Atreides\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #81c995;\u0027\u003e0.80\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"\"I know who my true friends are, Thufir,\" the Duke said.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Leto Atreides", "width": 3.3000000000000003}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Hawat", "label": "WORKS_FOR", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                WORKS_FOR\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027fo