": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Chusuk", "label": "LOCATED_IN", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                LOCATED_IN\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Chusuk \u2192 Theta Shalish\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"CHUSUK: fourth planet of Theta Shalish\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Theta Shalish", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Otheym", "label": "MEMBER_OF", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                MEMBER_OF\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Otheym \u2192 Fedaykin\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"the broad, flat features of the Fedaykin lieutenant\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Fedaykin", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Otheym", "label": "KNOWS", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                KNOWS\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Otheym \u2192 Reverend Mother\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"Otheym pressed past her, said: \"Follow me. Quickly, now.\"\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Reverend Mother", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Otheym", "label": "KNOWS", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                KNOWS\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Otheym \u2192 Chani Kynes\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"Otheym pressed palms together, said: \"I have brought Chani.\"\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Chani Kynes", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Otheym", "label": "MENTIONED_IN", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                MENTIONED_IN\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Otheym \u2192 Paul\u0027s words\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"\"It was Otheym,\" Paul said. \"He was listening.\"\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Paul\u0027s words", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Fedaykin lieutenant", "label": "MEMBER_OF", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                MEMBER_OF\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Fedaykin lieutenant \u2192 Fedaykin\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"the broad, flat features of the Fedaykin lieutenant\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Fedaykin", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#fdd663", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Shaddam IV", "label": "LEADS", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #fdd663;\u0027\u003e\n                LEADS\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Shaddam IV \u2192 Sardaukar\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #fdd663;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"a slim, elegant figure in a gray Sardaukar uniform\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Sardaukar", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#fdd663", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Shaddam IV", "label": "LEADS", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #fdd663;\u0027\u003e\n                LEADS\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Shaddam IV \u2192 his people\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #fdd663;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"The Padishah Emperor Shaddam IV led his people into the hall.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "his people", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#81c995", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "sister of Muad\u0027Dib", "label": "FAMILY_OF", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #81c995;\u0027\u003e\n                FAMILY_OF\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                sister of Muad\u0027Dib \u2192 Muad\u0027Dib\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #81c995;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"\"become acquainted with the sister of Muad\u0027Dib.\"\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Muad\u0027Dib", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.88}, "dashes": false, "from": "child", "label": "PARTICIPATES_IN", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                PARTICIPATES_IN\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                child \u2192 EVENT\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.80\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"The child sat down on the dais beside the throne, dangled her feet over the edge, kicking them.\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "EVENT", "width": 3.3000000000000003}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#fdd663", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "child", "label": "LEADS", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #fdd663;\u0027\u003e\n                LEADS\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                child \u2192 attacking groups\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #fdd663;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"\"This child here was in command of one of the attacking groups.\"\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "attacking groups", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#f28b82", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "the old woman", "label": "ENEMY_OF", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #f28b82;\u0027\u003e\n                ENEMY_OF\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                the old woman \u2192 Alia\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #f28b82;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"\"Kill her,\" the old woman muttered, and clutched the back of the throne for support. \"Kill her!\"\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "Alia", "width": 3.65}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.8200000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "oldest daughter", "label": "MENTIONED_IN", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                MENTIONED_IN\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                oldest daughter \u2192 suite\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.70\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 10px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 4px;\u0027\u003eEvidence:\u003c/div\u003e\n                \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; font-style: italic;\u0027\u003e\n                    \"the wide-eyed faces of his suite, seeing his oldest daughter\"\n                \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e", "to": "suite", "width": 2.9499999999999997}, {"arrows": {"to": {"enabled": true, "scaleFactor": 0.5}}, "color": {"color": "#8ab4f8", "opacity": 0.9400000000000001}, "dashes": false, "from": "Guild navigators", "label": "MADE", "smooth": {"type": "cubicBezier"}, "title": "\n        \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-family: Inter, sans-serif; max-width: 300px;\u0027\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e\n                MADE\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 12px; color: #9aa0a6; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Guild navigators \u2192 fatal decision\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027font-size: 11px; color: #e8eaed; margin-bottom: 8px;\u0027\u003e\n                Confidence: \u003cspan style=\u0027color: #8ab4f8;\u0027\u003e0.90\u003c/span\u003e\n            \u003c/div\u003e\n        \n            \u003cdiv style=\u0027padding-top: 8px; border-top: 1px solid #3c4043;\u0027\u003e\n 